      "message": "Thanks!\n\nHow does `ReturnAttributes()` relate to `Params()` and `Builtin()`?\n\n`BuiltinToAttribute(builtin.value(), /* depth_mode */)` is called on `param-\u003eBuiltin()`, not returned attribute right? Which depth_mode value shall I pass to  `BuiltinToAttribute()`?",
